@startuml
title States: a session
[*] --> Nameless
Nameless --> Named : choose a name
Nameless --> Nameless : choose a room [no name yet]
Named --> InRoom : choose a room
InRoom --> InRoom : choose another room
InRoom --> InRoom : say something
InRoom --> Named : leave
Named --> [*] : log out
InRoom --> [*] : log out
@enduml
